Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:24:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(studio): render hCaptcha only when a site key is set

Platform-mode builds that do not configure NEXT_PUBLIC_HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY
(for example a self-operated control plane with its own GoTrue) cannot
sign in: the invisible hCaptcha widget never initializes and the sign-in
and forgot-password forms wait on it.

Render the widget only when a site key is configured, in the sign-in,
forgot-password, SSO sign-in, sign-up, change-email and new-organization
pages. Every caller already treats a missing captcha ref as "no token",
so GoTrue instances without captcha enabled accept the request. The
billing payment dialogs are unchanged: they need Stripe, which a
self-operated control plane does not have.
